{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and retrieve it. Check its properties and perform specific task. Scan if necessary. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = RetrieveObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
